# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Everything here is either rebuilt inside the image
# or must never enter one. Without this, the context is >12GB (test-ledger alone is 5.5GB) and Next's
# standalone output would copy a real .env into the image.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets: role keypairs are passed as environment variables (see docs/ops/deploy.md), never baked in.
keys
**/keys/*.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.pem

# Anchor and validator artifacts: the SDK ships committed IDL modules, so none of this is needed.
vault/target
vault/test-ledger
vault/.anchor

*.log
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
web.Dockerfile
